# Design System

## Layout Standards

### Container System

**Always use responsive container approach:**

```tsx
// Standard container pattern
<div className="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8" />

// Section wrapper
<section className="relative flex items-center bg-white">
  <div className="container mx-auto">
    {/* Content */}
  </div>
</section>
```

### Spacing Scale

Use consistent gap and padding:
- `gap-4` / `gap-6` / `gap-8` / `gap-16` for component spacing
- `px-4 py-3.5` for header padding
- `px-4 py-16` for section padding
- `space-y-6 lg:space-y-8` for vertical content spacing

## Typography Scale

### Headings

```tsx
// Main hero title
className="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight"

// Section headings
className="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold"

// Navigation text
className="text-4 font-semibold"
```

### Body Text

```tsx
// Primary description
className="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed"

// Secondary text
className="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed"
```

## Component Standards

### Button Variants

Reference: [Button.tsx](mdc:src/components/atoms/Button.tsx), [CTAButton.tsx](mdc:src/components/atoms/CTAButton.tsx)

#### Outlined Buttons (Header)
- Small size: `px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm`
- Border: `border-header-border`
- Hover: `hover:bg-white/10`

#### CTA Buttons (Hero)
- Medium size: `px-8 py-3 md:px-10`
- Full rounded: `rounded-full`
- Strong hover: `hover:bg-gray-800`

### Navigation Patterns

Reference: [NavigationMenu.tsx](mdc:src/components/molecules/NavigationMenu.tsx)

- Gap between items: `gap-10`
- Mobile hide: `hidden md:block`
- Hover state: `hover:text-neutral-60`

## Visual Effects

### Header Effects

```tsx
// Backdrop blur with opacity overlay
<header className="backdrop-blur-3xl">
  <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-70" />
</header>
```

### Interactive States

```tsx
// Button hover overlays
<button className="group">
  <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10" />
</button>

// Smooth transitions
className="transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out"
```

## Responsive Behavior

### Breakpoint Usage

- **Mobile First**: Base styles for mobile
- **md: (768px+)**: Show navigation, adjust typography
- **lg: (1024px+)**: Two-column layouts, larger spacing
- **xl: (1280px+)**: Maximum typography sizes

### Layout Shifts

```tsx
// Single column → Two column
<div className="flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
  <div className="w-full lg:w-1/2">Left</div>
  <div className="w-full lg:w-1/2">Right</div>
</div>

// Stacked buttons → Row buttons
<div className="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:gap-6">
```

